{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視今晚舉行邁向59周年《萬千星輝賀台慶》，汪明荃領軍逾200位藝員傾力演出。現年63歲三屆視帝羅嘉良化身 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫電視今晚舉行邁向59周年《萬千星輝賀台慶》，汪明荃領軍逾200位藝員傾力演出。現年63歲三屆視帝羅嘉良化身神秘嘉賓重磅回歸，甫開場即以一套經典造型引爆全場高潮。這位傳奇小生帶領全台小生花旦締造出一個極具震撼力歷史性同框畫面。</p>\n<h2>羅嘉良白西裝黑超造型神還原《難兄難弟》李奇</h2>\n<p>逾100位藝員分批列隊步入將軍澳電視廣播城一廠舞台，為整場晚會揭開序幕。身穿全白西裝配搭黑色襯衫以及復古黑超造型現身大舞台，羅嘉良以壓倒性氣場空降現場。他中氣十足獻唱經典金曲《奇哥》及《難兄難弟》，無論唱腔抑或神態均完美複製當年紅極一時李奇一角，瞬間掀起全場集體回憶，身旁一眾新生代及上位小生花旦亦跟隨節拍拍手和唱。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509188267972491_2048667296afeedab2adb7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509188267972491_2048667296afeedab2adb7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509188576389142_2391432876afeedae29dee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509188576389142_2391432876afeedae29dee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>一線當家小生花旦齊集停車場載歌載舞</h2>\n<p>為配合重量級嘉賓震撼登場，大會特別安排極具氣勢排場迎接。鏡頭一轉切換至電視城停車場場景，陳豪與馬國明及譚俊彥等一線當家小生悉數列陣壓陣。隨後林夏薇與龔嘉欣及高海寧等當家花旦盛裝亮相，聯同《愛·回家之開心速遞》班底及《中年好聲音》唱將傾巢而出，逾100人齊集台前與嘉賓一同載歌載舞，展現無綫強大陣容氣勢。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509188837949717_13241035216afeedb15ec8b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509188837949717_13241035216afeedb15ec8b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509189356229441_1160293996afeedb6be538.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509189356229441_1160293996afeedb6be538.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>首辦東張女神盃甘詠寧成頭號勁敵李旻芳輕鬆備戰</h2>\n<p>除了重量級開場表演引發熱話，首辦東張女神盃同樣備受關注。參賽者有陳庭欣、何沛珈、甘詠寧、黎寬怡、李旻芳和梁敏巧。其中甘詠寧被外界視為頭號勁敵，梁敏巧過去憑藉多次追訪突發場面備受矚目，而李旻芳則表明抱持輕鬆心態參與今次競賽；最後由李旻芳奪得第一！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509189944012646_890810206afeedbc3823c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509189944012646_890810206afeedbc3823c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509190241731356_14579718766afeedbeca76a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509190241731356_14579718766afeedbeca76a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509190317918207_15441775976afeedbfa5666.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509190317918207_15441775976afeedbfa5666.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>汪明荃出戰紅地氈穿著逾4萬港元高級訂製服裝</h2>\n<p>盛裝出席紅地氈環節向來是各路藝人爭妍鬥麗戰場。領軍人物汪明荃今次選擇越南高級訂製服裝品牌最新春夏季成衣系列亮相。該款水滴設計在官方網站定價大約為4萬2千至4萬6千港元之間。她穿上鮮紅色長身連衣裙配搭同款短披肩及頭飾，加上雙手佩戴鮮紅色長皮手套，全身上下佈滿密集水滴狀圖案。</p>\n<p>這套極具視覺衝擊力打扮在人群中顯得格外搶眼，當她與同場司儀步上紅地氈合照時立刻成為全場焦點。這種佈滿規律圖案與強烈風格前衛設計，在視覺上被廣泛形容為猶如一粒巨型士多啤梨。大批網民紛紛在討論區留言發表意見，有人直指「佢carry到」，亦有評論表示「完全估唔到會有呢種視覺效果」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991816218_4217838376afef4bf902c1-1024x857.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"803\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991816218_4217838376afef4bf902c1-1024x857.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991816537_6433899146afef4c29f459-1024x738.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"692\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991816537_6433899146afef4c29f459-1024x738.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>《中年好聲音》譚輝智黃博挑戰跳唱 同台小朋友成MVP</h2>\n<p>《中年好聲音》出身的譚輝智與黃博首度合作挑戰跳唱，並聯同肥媽獻唱多首經典廣東歌，施展渾身解數炒熱氣氛。不過，這場演出的MVP就落在一班同台唱跳的小朋友身上，活潑可愛的演出為舞台增添不少生氣，搶鏡程度完全不輸一眾前輩。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-19-at-22.23.46_5993567206afef87c759e6-1024x752.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"705\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-19-at-22.23.46_5993567206afef87c759e6-1024x752.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-19-at-22.23.52_4077342956afef87416db0-1024x616.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"578\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-19-at-22.23.52_4077342956afef87416db0-1024x616.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6339315817471743376_y_18875874966afef87124b12-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_6339315817471743376_y_18875874966afef87124b12-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳煒姚子羚領軍炫舞女王 傅嘉莉率眾跳椅子舞</h2>\n<p>另一邊廂，陳煒與姚子羚領軍的「炫舞女王」大型歌舞表演同樣搶鏡，30位女藝人齊齊登場，在台上大展舞姿。傅嘉莉更率眾大跳椅子舞，配合節拍展現型格與嫵媚，將現場氣氛推高。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991820157_6213265506afef8688c1f7-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991820157_6213265506afef8688c1f7-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991820158_16913071866afef8628503d-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2991820158_16913071866afef8628503d-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_5186054868714589676_w_16381577076afef85e0d106-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_5186054868714589676_w_16381577076afef85e0d106-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_5186054868714589698_w_10833462526afef85b4064a-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_5186054868714589698_w_10833462526afef85b4064a-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_5186054868714589724_w_3202278546afef857778e1-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 羅嘉良 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/photo_5186054868714589724_w_3202278546afef857778e1-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%be%85%e5%98%89%e8%89%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅嘉良</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9b%a3%e5%85%84%e9%9b%a3%e5%bc%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">難兄難弟</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546143\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.564204+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1719,"images":17,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:38:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:44.874335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:37.242960+00:00","content_hash":"e8bb63486f131bfe5f483cad13231ef5c149190b089642d03bf5a8f8d9232f09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}